---
import BaseLayout from '../layouts/BaseLayout.astro';
import Breadcrumbs from '../components/Breadcrumbs.astro';

const lastUpdated = 'July 5, 2026';
---

<BaseLayout
  title="Terms & Conditions | Indispensable Digital"
  description="The terms and conditions governing use of the Indispensable Digital website and services."
>
  <Breadcrumbs items={[{ label: 'Terms & Conditions', href: '/terms-and-conditions/' }]} />

  <section class="page-hero" style="padding-bottom:40px">
    <div class="hero-bg"></div>
    <div class="wrap">
      <div class="eyebrow">Legal</div>
      <h1>Terms &amp; <span class="copper">Conditions</span></h1>
      <p>Last updated: {lastUpdated}</p>
    </div>
  </section>

  <section class="pad" style="padding-top:0">
    <div class="wrap legal-content">
      <p>These Terms &amp; Conditions ("Terms") govern your use of the Indispensable Digital website and any consulting services provided by Indispensable Digital ("we", "us", "our"). By accessing this website or engaging our services, you agree to these Terms.</p>

      <h2>1. Services</h2>
      <p>Indispensable Digital provides growth strategy, brand positioning, content, PR, and performance marketing consulting services. The specific scope, deliverables, timeline, and fees for any engagement are agreed separately in writing with each client.</p>

      <h2>2. Use of This Website</h2>
      <p>This website and its content are provided for general informational purposes. You agree not to misuse the site, attempt unauthorized access, or use it in any way that could damage, disable, or impair its functionality.</p>

      <h2>3. Intellectual Property</h2>
      <p>All content on this website - including text, graphics, logos, and design - is the property of Indispensable Digital unless otherwise stated, and may not be reproduced or distributed without prior written permission.</p>

      <h2>4. Engagement Terms</h2>
      <p>Any paid engagement with Indispensable Digital is subject to a separate agreement or statement of work, which will govern fees, timelines, confidentiality, and deliverables. These website Terms do not themselves create a service contract.</p>

      <h2>5. No Guarantee of Results</h2>
      <p>While we bring rigorous strategy and execution to every engagement, marketing and growth outcomes depend on many factors outside our control. We do not guarantee specific results, rankings, revenue, or growth figures.</p>

      <h2>6. Limitation of Liability</h2>
      <p>To the maximum extent permitted by law, Indispensable Digital shall not be liable for any indirect, incidental, or consequential damages arising from your use of this website or our services.</p>

      <h2>7. Third-Party Links</h2>
      <p>This website may link to third-party sites (such as LinkedIn). We are not responsible for the content or practices of any linked third-party site.</p>

      <h2>8. Governing Law</h2>
      <p>These Terms are governed by the laws of India, and any disputes shall be subject to the exclusive jurisdiction of the courts of New Delhi, India.</p>

      <h2>9. Changes to These Terms</h2>
      <p>We may revise these Terms from time to time. Continued use of the website after changes are posted constitutes acceptance of the revised Terms.</p>

      <h2>10. Contact Us</h2>
      <p>Questions about these Terms can be directed to <a href="mailto:contact@indispensabledigital.com" class="copper">contact@indispensabledigital.com</a> or <a href="tel:+917000123171" class="copper">+91-7000123171</a>.</p>
    </div>
  </section>
</BaseLayout>

<style>
  .legal-content{max-width:800px}
  .legal-content h2{color:var(--cream);font-size:1.4rem;margin:36px 0 14px}
  .legal-content h2:first-child{margin-top:0}
  .legal-content p{color:var(--muted);font-weight:300;margin-bottom:16px;font-size:1rem}
  .legal-content ul{color:var(--muted);font-weight:300;margin:0 0 16px 22px}
  .legal-content li{margin-bottom:8px}
</style>
